<section class="check-understanding"><exercise data-content-id="2f1f631d-86fb-4a2c-bbb4-bf2eafd59a62"><problem><para>
      <para> What will the height of the tree be in 14 months? </para>
      <para>Enter your answer here:</para>
    </para></problem><solution><para>19.5</para><para>
      <para>The correct answer is 19.5.</para>
    </para></solution></exercise></section>
